cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark suite, datasets, or experimental findings in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "A Reproducible Quad-Platform Benchmark Suite for Isolating Orchestration Overhead, Schema Prefill Scaling, and Microarchitectural Dynamics in Local LLM Agents (macOS, Linux, Windows NVIDIA, Windows Intel iGPU)"
abstract: "An open, reproducible quad-platform experimental benchmark suite comparing autonomous AI agent orchestration runtimes (Go native, Node.js V8, Bun JSC, CPython) across Apple Silicon M4 (macOS Darwin ARM64), Ubuntu Linux x86_64, Windows 11 x86_64 (NVIDIA dGPU), and Windows 10/11 x86_64 (Intel HD Graphics 4600 iGPU UMA). Incorporates hardware microarchitectural telemetry, non-parametric hypothesis testing, and active Tool-RAG schema pruning under standardized physical execution."
